    2. Place marker at random position (r, c) within the grid
    3. Pick marker color uniformly from the 9-element ring cycle
    4. Fill entire grid with orange (7), then set grid[r][c] = marker_color
  notes:
    - This task is trivially generatable input-first since inputs are just a single pixel on orange
    - No constraint conflicts possible; any position + any cycle color is valid
```
